@*
    Razor Comments:
    ***************
    - are server-side comments
    - are removed during rendering 
    - are NOT sent to the browser's HTML output

    Use Razor comments for notes and explanations inside .cshtml files
*@

@* 
    The home page "Index.cshtml" is the application's landing page.

    This page introduces the Inventory Manager project
    before we add the actual inventory functionality. 
*@

@{
    /*
     * ViewData:
     * *********
     * ViewData is a dictionary provided by ASP.NET Core MVC.
     *
     * It allows a Controller or View to pass small pieces of data
     * to another part of the MVC application.
     *
     * In this case, the shared layout (_Layout.cshtml)
     * reads the "Title" value and displays it as the browser page title.
     */
    ViewData["Title"] = "Inventory Manager";
}

